          "key": "headline",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Bottleneck: a saturated GPU (confidence: likely; thresholds not yet calibrated on real GPUs)",
          "tone": "plain"
        },
        {
          "audience": "markdown",
          "item": true,
          "key": "evidence",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "evidence: the GPU was saturated at its power limit (busy 100%, at 69 of 70 W, SM clock 1256 of 1590 MHz): server settings that run more at once cannot add throughput here; what can is less work per request (shorter prompts or answers, cached shared prompts), a smaller or quantized model, or a faster GPU",
          "tone": "plain"
        },
        {
          "audience": "markdown",
          "item": true,
          "key": "not_crossed",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "not crossed: queueing before scheduling, decode memory bandwidth",
          "tone": "plain"
        },
        {
          "audience": "markdown",
          "item": true,
          "key": "not_crossed_uncalibrated",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "not crossed (uncalibrated thresholds): the load generator, KV-cache capacity, prefill compute, the per-step token budget, prefill stalling decode, API-server CPU, attention / long context",
          "tone": "plain"
        },
        {
          "audience": "markdown",
          "item": true,
